        <a href="/tools/irmaa-appeal-letter-generator/" class="mp-related-btn">Use This Free Tool</a>
        <span class="mp-no-acct-text">No account needed</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mp-related-card">
        <h3>Medicare Savings Program Estimator</h3>
        <p>Check if state assistance programs can pay your $202.90 Part B monthly premium for you.</p>
        <a href="/tools/medicare-savings-estimator/" class="mp-related-btn">Use This Free Tool</a>
        <span class="mp-no-acct-text">No account needed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Internal Links Section -->
  <div class="mp-internal-links">
    <p>
      For a full understanding of how Medicare premiums, deductibles, and IRMAA surcharges work, visit our <a href="/medicare/">Medicare education hub</a> — and read our in-depth guide on <a href="/medicare/costs-and-penalties">Medicare costs, deductibles, and late enrollment penalties</a>. If your income triggers a surcharge, estimate your exact tier with our <a href="/tools/medicare-irmaa-calculator/">Medicare IRMAA calculator</a>. If your income dropped recently, use our <a href="/tools/irmaa-appeal-letter-generator/">IRMAA appeal letter generator</a>. On a fixed income? Check whether your state will pay your premium through our <a href="/tools/medicare-savings-estimator/">Medicare Savings Program estimator</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       ELEMENT 10 — EDUCATIONAL DISCLAIMER
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
